==== Serial ====
The [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial|serial port]] is on the unpopulated header labelled "console"/"J2". Pins are, from the pin closest to J2 Gnd, Rx, Tx, Vcc. Use a 5V <-> 3.3V level shifter. Some of the boards are shipped with a populated header. Use 57600 8N1, hard & soft flow control OFF.

